   "value": "spinWeightHoloMeta = Private`fieldProperty[S, \"WeightHolo\"];\nspinWeightAntiMeta = Private`fieldProperty[St, \"WeightAntiHolo\"];\ntest20 = MatchQ[spinWeightHoloMeta, _Function] && MatchQ[spinWeightAntiMeta, _Function] && Private`fieldProperty[S, \"WeightAntiHolo\"] === 0 && Private`fieldProperty[St, \"WeightHolo\"] === 0 && spinWeightHoloMeta[S[{a,\"chiral\"},-1/2,{{1/2,\\[Mu]},{3/2,\\[Nu]}},2,z]] === Private`weightHolo[S[{a,\"chiral\"},-1/2,{{1/2,\\[Mu]},{3/2,\\[Nu]}},2,z]] && spinWeightAntiMeta[St[{a,\"chiral\"},-1/2,{{1/2,\\[Mu]}},1,zb]] === Private`weightAntiHolo[St[{a,\"chiral\"},-1/2,{{1/2,\\[Mu]}},1,zb]];\nPrint[\"Test 20 (spin DefineField weight metadata functions match runtime weights): \", If[test20, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest20",
