  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "expectedMu21 = (1/2 - I/2) R[expH[{-1/2, 1/2, 3/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] - (1/2 + I/2) R[dH[3, 0, z], expH[{-1/2, 1/2, -1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]];\nexpectedMulti121 = -1/2 R[expH[{-1/2, 3/2, 3/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] - I/2 R[dH[2, 0, z], expH[{-1/2, -1/2, 3/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] - I/2 R[dH[3, 0, z], expH[{-1/2, 3/2, -1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] + R[dH[2, 0, z], dH[3, 0, z], expH[{-1/2, -1/2, -1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]]/2;\nexpectedMulti112 = (-I/2) R[expH[{-1/2, 5/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] + I/4 R[dH[2, 1, z], expH[{-1/2, -3/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] + I/4 R[dH[2, 0, z], dH[2, 0, z], expH[{-1/2, -3/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]] + R[dH[2, 0, z], dH[2, 1, z], expH[{-1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]]/4 - R[dH[2, 0, z], dH[2, 0, z], dH[2, 0, z], expH[{-1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2}, z]]/4;\ntest29 = Bosonize[S[sPlus, -1/2, {{2, 1}}, 0, z]] === expectedMu21 && Bosonize[S[sPlus, -1/2, {{1, 1}, {2, 1}}, 0, z]] === expectedMulti121 && Bosonize[S[sPlus, -1/2, {{1, 1}, {1, 2}}, 0, z]] === expectedMulti112 && Head[Bosonize[S[sPlus, -1/2, {{1, 1}}, 1, z]]] === Bosonize;\nPrint[\"Test 29 (index-first convention, exact multimode descendants, and der guard): \", If[test29, \"PASSED\", \"FAILED\"]];\ntest29",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
